<STYLE ID="6">"When it was decided 3 years ago that we'd come back to Motoki-cho, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> told me, 'The place next door is empty.' I begged </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, and we moved into the place we're in now."</STYLE><PG>
That's absurd...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
